WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.293
- My name is Michelle Khare,

00:00:01.293 --> 00:00:04.543
and I'm a professional cyclist
for the BMW Happy Tooth team,

00:00:04.543 --> 00:00:07.752
and today I'm challenging
legendary stuntman Andy Bell

00:00:07.752 --> 00:00:09.799
and his Ferrari to a race.

00:00:09.799 --> 00:00:12.754
(rock music)

00:00:24.754 --> 00:00:27.283
I have no idea how today is gonna go.

00:00:27.283 --> 00:00:30.700
- I'm going to just be
chewing my fingernails off

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:34.447
if I'm sitting dead stop
on the 405 in this car,

00:00:34.447 --> 00:00:37.011
600 horsepower just waiting to be used

00:00:37.011 --> 00:00:39.136
and going zero miles an hour.

00:00:39.136 --> 00:00:42.187
(rock music)

00:00:44.833 --> 00:00:48.456
- I am the reigning U23
national champion for cycling,

00:00:48.456 --> 00:00:51.325
and this year is my first
year riding as a professional.

00:00:51.325 --> 00:00:54.471
Today, I'm gonna be riding
some pretty sweet equipment.

00:00:54.471 --> 00:00:57.640
It's basically the Ferrari
equivalent for a bicycle.

00:00:57.640 --> 00:01:00.765
- I'm a professional
stuntman, race car driver,

00:01:00.765 --> 00:01:04.049
race truck driver, part-time daredevil.

00:01:04.049 --> 00:01:05.348
Pretty much do it all.

00:01:05.348 --> 00:01:08.628
2011 Ferrari 458 Italia.

00:01:08.628 --> 00:01:10.771
Doesn't need much
explaining, I don't think.

00:01:10.771 --> 00:01:12.740
It's got that yellow horsey on the front.

00:01:12.740 --> 00:01:14.000
That means it's pretty badass.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:15.317
- Today's race is very different

00:01:15.317 --> 00:01:17.235
from any normal cycling race.

00:01:17.235 --> 00:01:20.024
We will be battling regular
Los Angeles traffic.

00:01:20.024 --> 00:01:21.961
- We're gonna be taking
two different routes down

00:01:21.961 --> 00:01:23.754
from up here, the top of Topanga Canyon,

00:01:23.754 --> 00:01:25.438
to Santa Monica Pier.

00:01:25.438 --> 00:01:28.653
- That is necessary, because
bikes can't go on the highway.

00:01:30.099 --> 00:01:31.562
- [Woman] On your marks!

00:01:31.562 --> 00:01:32.972
(engine revving)

00:01:32.972 --> 00:01:33.896
Set!

00:01:34.511 --> 00:01:35.160
Go!

00:01:35.160 --> 00:01:38.112
(peppy rock music)

00:01:43.190 --> 00:01:45.539
- [Andy] Let's hope
for no traffic up here.

00:01:58.380 --> 00:02:00.185
Oh, come on!

00:02:00.185 --> 00:02:02.176
Don't you know we're racing?

00:02:21.882 --> 00:02:23.932
Carpooling the Ferrari.

00:02:47.960 --> 00:02:49.099
- Woo!

00:02:49.099 --> 00:02:50.690
Yes!

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:53.162
- [Andy] Oh, no! What?

00:02:53.162 --> 00:02:55.554
Aw, man!

00:02:55.554 --> 00:02:57.004
You beat me!

00:02:57.004 --> 00:02:57.822
- I'm sorry, man!

00:02:57.822 --> 00:02:59.132
- What the hell, Michelle?

00:02:59.132 --> 00:03:01.313
- [Michelle] Traffic, I guess.
- [Andy] Seriously, yeah.

00:03:01.313 --> 00:03:02.283
- [Andy] Obviously.
- [Michelle] Ferrari can't

00:03:02.283 --> 00:03:03.284
- [Michelle] even beat traffic.

00:03:03.284 --> 00:03:04.347
- How was your ride?

00:03:04.347 --> 00:03:04.990
- It was great.

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:08.148
We hit about 40 miles an hour
going down the first descent,

00:03:08.148 --> 00:03:10.716
which was super scary but super fun.

00:03:10.716 --> 00:03:12.372
Kinda like driving a Ferrari.

00:03:12.372 --> 00:03:13.352
- I think you had me by what,

00:03:13.352 --> 00:03:14.703
like six minutes or something, right?

00:03:14.703 --> 00:03:16.028
- Yeah, it was really close.

00:03:16.028 --> 00:03:19.385
- Accidents and people getting in my way,

00:03:19.385 --> 00:03:20.860
and then red lights,

00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:22.980
the exit here in Santa
Monica was terrible, so...

00:03:22.980 --> 00:03:26.491
Give it A, not only did you
win, but you also got fit,

00:03:26.491 --> 00:03:28.765
and I just got fatter sitting in the car.

00:03:28.765 --> 00:03:31.829
Maybe I can just get one of
those baby things that you sit

00:03:31.829 --> 00:03:32.967
behind you
- [Michelle] Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:03:32.967 --> 00:03:34.304
- [Andy] and I could
just like, have a beer,

00:03:34.304 --> 00:03:35.530
and you can just tow me around.

00:03:35.530 --> 00:03:36.403
- [Michelle] Okay.

00:03:36.403 --> 00:03:37.061
- [Andy] Okay, look--

00:03:37.061 --> 00:03:38.473
- [Michelle] We can do
that next video (laughs).

00:03:38.473 --> 00:03:38.996
- [Andy] That's way better.

00:03:38.996 --> 00:03:41.342
I'll put a Ferrari sticker on
the side of it or something.

00:03:41.342 --> 00:03:42.213
Thanks, Buzzfeed.

00:03:42.213 --> 00:03:43.382
Good times.

